"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-07-01T04:39:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-11T01:42:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8115) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.95 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI don't know if this is strictly a *bug* per se, but it's unexpected behavior and there doesn't seem to be a quick an easy solution.\n\nUsing print_rich() will convert bbcode to ansi code, so when the _log_message is called on a custom Logger, there will always be a [0m ending on the string.\n\n<img width=\"929\" height=\"465\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e187f672-98c6-42ec-8826-0d7098427319\" />\n\nIf there were handy function to convert ansi to bbcode, that would be one way to work around this.  Also, perhaps print_rich should not always append the [0m if there are no codes added in the string?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a custom Logger that implements _log_message then call print_rich(\"some text\") and note that the message string passed in has [0m appended to it.\n\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n@onready var label: Label = $Label\n\nclass TestLogger extends Logger:\n\tvar label : Label\n\tfunc _log_message(message: String, _error: bool) -> void:\n\t\tlabel.text = message\n\t\tbreakpoint # Note that [0m is appended to message\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar logger := TestLogger.new()\n\tlogger.label = label\n\tOS.add_logger(logger)\n\tprint_rich(\"This has a weird ansi ending.\")\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_log_ansi_codes.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29533479/test_log_ansi_codes.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120806/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120806/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}